  "current_seo_title_en": null,
  "current_meta_ar": "مقشر للجسم ومرطب من آيمي يجمع مقشر آيمي المرطبغني بفيتامين E، ومضادات الأكسدة برائحته المميزه والذي يعانق بلورات الملح ليعزز روح الهدوء  بأفضل سعر في السعودية",
  "current_meta_en": "Rich with shea butter, mango butter, well-ground nut peels and sea salt, this creamy peel provides gentle and effective peeling Helps eliminate dead cells and prevents dry skin, the combination of this product with the scent of lavender oil helps you to relax and leaves the skin smooth ready for hydrationsize: 250 ml:IngredientsAm\"is creamy body scrub collects a combination of ultra-hydrating natural oils (shea butter, mango butter, rice bran, argan oil) that act as natural supplements that nourish your skin being rich in vitamin E, antioxidants and fatty acids that stimulate the production of enhanced natural collagen to regenerate skin cells. It helps to standardize skin tone, increase its freshness and flexibility and retain moisture, making it less susceptible to stretch marksAnd well-ground nuts peels mixed with sea salt remove dead skin cells, in addition to the distinctive lavender flower oil scent that gives calm and relaxation to the body:UsageIt is used 2 to 3 times a week on dry or damp skin using mild massage movements. Focus on areas that tend to be rough (heels, knees, elbows...) Then rinse it. It is preferable to moisturize the skin after using Amy\"s shaken butter to get its gloss and super smoothness",
